 1900) due to human activities, primarily fossil fuel burning, which increases heat-trapping greenhouse gas levels in Earth's atmosphere.","wo":"Tàngooru àdduna bi mooy luy tàngal klimaa bi ci suuf si ci diir bu yàgg, yu tàmbalikoo seetlu jamono yi usine yi di sooga xew (diggante 1850 ak 1900) te nit ñi ñoo waral, li ci njëkk mooy li ñuy jëfandikoo energie fosil, bi nga xamni dafay tëye tàngoor wi gaz à effet de serre di bàyyi ci jawwu ji.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTangoru addouna bi moy louy tangal climat bi si souf si thi diir bou yague, you tambaliko setlou diamono yi usine yi di soga hew (digante 1850 ak 1900) té nitt gni nio waral, li si ndieuk moy li gnuy dieufandiko energie fossile, bi nga khamni dafay teuye tangor wi gaz à effet de serre di bayyi si djaw dji.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2280,"row":{"en":"It does. I don't know what to do.","wo":"Du ndànk sax. Xamuma lan laay def.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDou ndankh sakh khamouma lane lay def\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2281,"row":{"en":"Ayanda: That's too bad. Cats are really great companions.","wo":"Ayanda: Massa waay. Muus ay wéttal yu baax lañu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAyanda: Massa waye. Mouss ay wettal you bakh lagnou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2282,"row":{"en":"Over time, these organisms evolved into more complex forms of life, such as plants and animals.","wo":"Jamono di dem, mbindéef yi tàmbali nekk yeneen mbindéef yu gëna mag te wuute, lu ci melni ay garab ak baayima.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJamono di dem mbindef yi tambali neuk yenen mbindef you geuna mag té wouté lou thi melni ay garab ak bayima\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2283,"row":{"en":"Just sign up for an account and start adding products to your cart.","wo":"Dangay dugg ci benn kontu rek ba noppi nga jël lila neex def ci sa pañe.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDangay dougg si bene compte rek 